# Ye 4 lines ka matlab, GitHub pe ye files nahi jaani chahiye:

# myenv/: virtual environment, bahut heavy hota hai. Uski jagah requirements.txt kaafi hai.
# __pycache__/: Python ki auto-bani cache files, kaam ki nahi.
# db.sqlite3: tera local database file, usme tera test data hai. Deploy pe Postgres use hoga.
# .env: secret keys/passwords hote hain, public repo pe jaana khatarnak hai 🔒

# Agar .env file tere project mein hai hi nahi, to bhi line rakh sakta hai, koi nuksan nahi